meta {
  name: profiles
}

auth {
  mode: inherit
}

docs {
  Customer profile routes under /profiles/.
  Detail PATCH: profiles/PATCH Profile.bru — admin/associate may set
  is_onboarding_sent / is_onboarding_completed (list serializers keep completed read-only).

  List/detail + v2 nested customer_profile expose
  is_latest_consent_given (bool): true when profile's latest
  consent-history set (all consent names, same version) matches newest ConsentForm.
}
